#
# torusquads.obj - Torus, quad faces
#
# Geometry:   a torus centred on the origin, its axis along z, ring radius
#             1.5 out to the middle of the tube and tube radius 0.6, so it
#             spans 4.2 × 4.2 × 1.2.
# Components: 640 vertices, 693 UV coordinates, 640 vertex normals, and 640
#             quad faces, 32 rings of 20 each. The normals are the analytic
#             outward normals of the surface, unit length. The UVs run 0 to 1
#             once around each way, u around the ring and v around the tube,
#             with the seam row and column duplicated so the wrap does not
#             fold the map back over itself.
# Used by:    gouraudtoruses.
#
o torusquads
